  "单笔计划亏损 / USDT": "Planned loss per trade / USDT",
  "币安杠杆上限是交易所允许值，不代表当前策略的安全倍数。仓位按止损及费用预算计算，单笔名义价值不超过150 USDT；止损与预计强平价之间须留有缓冲，否则拒绝开仓。": "Binance leverage limits are exchange permissions, not safe strategy recommendations. Size positions from stop and fee budgets, with notional at most 150 USDT. Require a buffer between stop and estimated liquidation price or reject entry.",
