  "等待维持保证金档位、行情与资金费数据": "Waiting for maintenance-margin brackets, market data, and funding",
  "止损至强平的间距以该品种的价格差表示。预检通过仅表示当前规则允许候选仓位，实际开仓前会重新校验。预计强平价是模型值；Demo及实盘成交后另核对交易所返回值。跳空、滑点及数据中断仍可能令实际亏损超出预算。": "Stop-to-liquidation buffer is expressed in instrument price units. Passing preflight only qualifies a candidate under current rules; revalidate before entry. Estimated liquidation is a model value; verify exchange values after Demo or live fills. Gaps, slippage, and data outages may exceed the loss budget.",
