  "本地模拟止损依赖程序持续运行；Demo及实盘保护单由交易所执行。界面中的价格与权益并非收益承诺。": "Local simulated stops require a running process; Demo and live protective orders execute at the exchange. Displayed prices and equity are not a return promise.",
