  "连接并检查 Luna 初筛": "Connect and check Luna screening",
  "连接后先检查一次 Luna，逐条显示错误。点击下方完整对比才会调用 Sol；初筛失败的原文会直接交给 Sol 复核。完整对比最多 1 次 Luna、10 次 Sol，每次最多45秒；无新增或修订不重复调用。费用由模型服务计收。": "Check Luna once after connecting and show errors individually. Sol is called only for the full comparison; original text from failed screening goes directly to Sol. A full comparison allows at most 1 Luna and 10 Sol calls, each up to 45 seconds. No repeat without new or revised input. Provider charges apply.",
